    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: eventLoss
      value: 25
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event0Text
      value: FLY BOY, I'm spreading slander over the radio! The radio waves shall
        spread propoganda for miles!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event1Text
      value: FLY BOY! I removed the tires off the bus! I hope you took an elective
        in automobiles!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event2Text
      value: FLY BOY, I'm vandalizing the billboards! My agenda will be all over
        the interstate!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event3Text
      value: FLY BOY, I pushed over a don't step on the grass sign! Muddy boots will
        conquer the earth!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event4Text
      value: FLY BOY, I got a car stuck on the crane! Imagine what their premiums
        gonna look like!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event5Text
      value: FLY BOY, I pushed over a trash can! Now trash like you is all over the
        city!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event6Text
      value: FLY BOY! I tampered with the mailbox! This is a felony and I'll become
        a C-tier villian in no time!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event7Text
      value: FLY BOY! I took someone's grandma and stuck them in a tree! Lets hope
        her balance is good!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event8Text
      value: FLY BOY! I shut off a small portion of the power grid! The streetlights
        are ruined, just like your reputation!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event9Text
      value: FLY BOY! I vadalized a bunch of park benches! Now nobody will have anywhere
        to sit!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event0Audio
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d9b6104eca320454b8584e0689186957, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event10Text
      value: FLY BOY! I littered! Give it a few thousand years and the microplastics
        I spread shall take the world!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
      propertyPath: event11Text
      value: FLY BOY! I vandalized the bus stop! The air quality of this city shall
        be ruined as the bus industry falls!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5829672375481641816, guid: 324bd770aa516d549b08a15b51efca06, type: 3}
